{
  "title": "How to reduce photo size to 20 KB on mobile",
  "description": "Get a photo or signature under 20 KB on your phone without blur — the right steps, which exams need it, and why going below the minimum gets rejected.",
  "lang": "en",
  "slug": "reduce-photo-size-to-20kb-on-mobile",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z",
