  "body": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "“Photo 20 kb” is one of the most searched phrases before every exam season. A phone camera photo is 2–5 MB. The form wants something like 20 KB. That is 100 to 250 times smaller — and most people do it from their phone, not a computer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "This guide shows how to get a photo or signature to 20 KB on mobile, without the face turning into a blurry mess. (If you have been searching “photo ka size kam kaise kare”, this is the answer.)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "First: is it “under 20 KB” or “20 to 50 KB”?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "This is the trap. Read your notice carefully:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "IBPS / SBI signature:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " 10–20 KB. So 20 KB is the "
            },
            {
              "text": "maximum",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "IBPS / SBI photo:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " 20–50 KB. So 20 KB is the "
            },
            {
              "text": "minimum",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " — a 15 KB photo gets rejected as too small."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "SSC signature:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " 10–20 KB."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Bihar Police photo and signature:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " 15–25 KB."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "So “make it 20 KB” can mean very different things. Always check the latest official notice, then pick a target inside the range — not exactly on the edge."
        }
      ]
    },
